  "source_note": "<!-- zh -->\n漫画分镜。排版：闪回嵌套，主面板内嵌小格表现记忆、回忆或过去片段。让该分镜机制决定页面结构、阅读顺序、主次画格和镜头节奏；输出一张完整单页漫画页面，画格共同讲述连续情节，角色外观在各格保持一致。\n\n<!-- en -->\nComic storyboard. Layout: Inset Memory Flashback, main panels embedded with smaller vintage or bordered insets representing memories or past events. Let this storyboard mechanism determine the page structure, reading flow, panel hierarchy, and pacing; output a complete single-page comic where panels tell a continuous story with consistent characters.\n",
